  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECT/UNODC: Improving Migration Management &amp; Migrant Protection in selected Silk Route countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Contribute to migrant protection in the target countries covering all phases of (in and out) migration, including countering and preventing irregular migration, Trafficking in Human Beings and Smuggling of Migrants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific Objective (SO) 3: Increase the effectiveness of responses to trafficking in persons (TIP)&lt;a href=&quot;#_ftn1&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[1]&lt;/a&gt; and smuggling of migrants (SOM) in target countries, with a particular focus on criminal justice elements, in line with international law and with full respect for human rights.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
